WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.768
-Singer Britney Spears's father,
Jamie Spears,

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:04.771
said he'd be willing
to eventually step down

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.206
as her conservator
amid public pressure

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:10.009
and after Britney's new lawyer,
Mathew Rosengart,

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.677
filed a petition
to have him removed

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:14.013
from controlling her finances,
which means --

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.215
-Wow, good for her.

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:18.517
-I'm sorry. This is one of
my writers, Dina Gusovsky.

00:00:18.517 --> 00:00:20.119
Dina, what's the matter?

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:21.854
Are you not happy
that Britney Spears

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:24.457
may finally be removed
from her conservatorship?

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.392
-No, I'm thrilled for her.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:29.595
-Disappointed that it took this
long for people to believe her?

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.265
-I mean, yeah,
but that's not it.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:34.366
-So then what's the problem?

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:37.804
-How come Britney Spears
found a nice Jewish lawyer

00:00:37.804 --> 00:00:39.972
and I still can't?

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.008
-Oh, geez.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.844
-Seth, if you think being in
a conservatorship is difficult,

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:48.013
try being a single Jewish woman
approaching 35.

00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:50.382
And yet you don't see Hulu
and "The New York Times"

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:51.451
joining forces to make

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.920
an Emmy-nominated documentary
about me.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.355
-Dina, I think
it's important to note

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.924
that Britney Spears's new lawyer
is representing her.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.126
She's not dating
this Jewish lawyer.

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:01.527
-Well, neither am I.

00:01:01.527 --> 00:01:04.230
I'm not dating
any Jewish lawyer.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.699
Seth, how do you think
relationships start?

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:08.100
At work.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.604
Trust me, it's a good thing
you're married and "not Jewish."

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:12.972
Otherwise, you would eventually

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:14.773
have to break up with me
or fire me.

00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:19.678
And we all know
I'm irreplaceable as a writer.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:22.882
-Dina, I know dating
must be hard,

00:01:22.882 --> 00:01:25.284
but you have plenty of time left
to find someone.

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:27.487
-Seth, even J-Lo had to resort

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:29.054
to getting back together
with her ex.

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:30.589
I mean, what hope is there

00:01:30.589 --> 00:01:33.326
for those of us
with uninsurable asses?

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:36.129
-Look, Dina, maybe you could
broaden your search.

00:01:36.129 --> 00:01:38.864
Do you have to marry
a Jewish lawyer?

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:41.100
-No, not necessarily.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.602
I mean, there's really only one

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.305
who meets my qualifications
anyway, and he's already taken.

00:01:46.305 --> 00:01:47.740
-Let me guess.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:51.143
Are we back to talking about
Second Gentleman Doug Emhoff?

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:52.645
-You know it.

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.347
Look at this guy.

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:59.685
He's got me in a high holi-daze
all year-round.

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.287
-Well, Dina,
I guess it's too bad

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:04.056
that he's already married
to Vice President Kamala Harris.

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:06.091
-I don't care
if he's into goyim.

00:02:06.091 --> 00:02:08.261
I'd still destroy him.

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:14.767
-Look, I get the fact
that he's a successful lawyer

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:17.236
and he holds a historic
and powerful office.

00:02:17.236 --> 00:02:21.007
But do you actually find him
to be that much of a stud?

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.875
-Uh, yeah, I do.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:25.945
I mean, just seeing his photo
gets me all excited.

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:28.114
Seth, I don't want
to get too graphic.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.715
-No, Dina, please don't.

00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:32.118
-But it's a hot August day
in Panty Town,

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:34.854
and the neighborhood kids just
turned on the fire hydrant.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:38.491
-Dina, I will turn off
your microphone.

00:02:38.491 --> 00:02:40.393
-Who cares?
There's no audience.

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.061
And these guys love it.
Am I right?

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.630
-Do not encourage the crew!

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:48.400
And, crew,
do not encourage Dina!

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:51.170
-Look, Seth, maybe I can
be happy for Britney

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.404
and her new Jewish lawyer.

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:54.874
I mean, she and I
do have a lot in common.

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:56.175
-Oh, really?

00:02:56.175 --> 00:03:00.013
-♪ Because I'm not
that innocent ♪

00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:02.749
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.752 --> 00:03:08.855
-Let's make sure
Jennifer Hudson left.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:09.788
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.788 --> 00:03:11.057
Dina Gusovsky, everybody.

